## Simulink Model (for capstone documentation)

To create the Simulink visual model for your report:

```matlab
>> cd('c:\projects\p1\New folder\matlab')
>> create_simulink_model    % Run the function from scada_simulink_guide.m
```

This creates `scada_tank_model.slx` with the basic blocks. You'll need to manually connect them and arrange the layout for your report screenshot.

> [!NOTE]
> The Simulink model is for **academic presentation**. The MATLAB script (`run_all_scenarios.m`) is the actual data generator because it can batch-process all 170 scenarios automatically.
